00:48:07.920 --> 00:48:11.880
of what can the righteous do, even as we evaluate where we are in our own lives, what can we

00:48:11.880 --> 00:48:12.880
do?

00:48:12.880 --> 00:48:14.600
Pray, praise, and proclaim.

00:48:14.600 --> 00:48:20.200
Lord, help us, empower us to continue to do your will.

00:48:20.200 --> 00:48:23.720
I pray that you would work as only you can, for it's in Christ's name we pray.

00:48:23.720 --> 00:48:24.720
Would you stand with me?

00:48:24.720 --> 00:48:25.720
Heads are bowed, eyes are closed.

00:48:25.720 --> 00:48:29.840
We'll have a moment of invitation as we do at the end of our services, give you an opportunity

00:48:29.840 --> 00:48:32.080
to respond.

00:48:32.080 --> 00:48:34.480
Kimberly will play in just a moment, quietly on the piano.

00:48:34.480 --> 00:48:38.799
If you're not sure of heaven, but Mark's here with a Bible, Holly's here with a Bible.

00:48:38.799 --> 00:48:41.840
We'll take a Bible and show you how you can know for sure that heaven is your home.

00:48:41.840 --> 00:48:45.160
Don't leave here without knowing for sure that heaven is your home.

00:48:45.160 --> 00:48:49.160
But maybe you just get a little overwhelmed, a little anxious with all the things going

00:48:49.160 --> 00:48:51.440
on in our world today.

00:48:51.440 --> 00:48:54.440
Maybe you just need to come and have a little talk with the Lord and just make some commitments

00:48:54.440 --> 00:48:55.440
to the Lord.

00:48:55.440 --> 00:48:59.280
God, by your help and with your enablement, by your grace, I'm going to continue to pray

00:48:59.720 --> 00:49:02.720
and to praise and to proclaim, God help me.

00:49:02.720 --> 00:49:04.440
As Kimberly plays, the altar is open.

